# ── Observability & Dashboarding ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore everything inside the Prometheus binary folder...
prometheus-2.51.0.linux-amd64/*

# ...BUT force Git to track these specific configuration files inside it:
!prometheus-2.51.0.linux-amd64/prometheus.yml
!prometheus-2.51.0.linux-amd64/aegis_alert_rules.yml

# Ignore local Grafana database mounts and extra Prometheus data
